{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c7201a3-7979-8bd4-8264-3af29b1d96da",
  "created_at": "2026-01-18T12:43:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:39:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, hello. I am calling the storm line, because City Hall is closed today, Sunday? I hope this is the right number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. The storm line stays open when City Hall's closed. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My street is not plowed. It is very cold this week, and there is a little snow on the ground, just a dusting, but it is frozen, like ice under. My car cannot go out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ayrault Street. Four six seven Ayrault Street. In the Historic Hill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four sixty-seven Ayrault. Got it. And nobody's been down there at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nobody. I look out the window in the morning, and again now. Nothing. My street is a dead end, you know. The dead end is always plowed last. Every time. I understand this, but it is always last, always, and it is Sunday afternoon already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:40:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Dead ends do tend to come at the end of the route, and with a light snow like this the crews are usually doing the main roads and hills first. Are you stuck in, or is it more that it's slick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:40:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, a little. The ice is hard. I am seventy-something, I do not want to walk on it. And I want to go to the pharmacy tomorrow. So, when will it be cleared? Do you know when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check the route sheet for you. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:41:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Ayrault is on the second pass for the Hill. So they'd get to it this afternoon or evening, and if they get held up, first thing in the morning before people head out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This evening or tomorrow morning. Okay. [pause] It is a little frustrating, because last time it was the same. I called, they said later, and later was the next day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'm putting a note in for four sixty-seven Ayrault so the crew sees it's a dead end with an older resident who needs to get out. Would you like a call back if it changes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. My number is four zero one, five five five, zero one eight four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-four. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Samir Tran. T-R-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Tran. In the meantime, if you have salt or sand, a little on your steps will help with the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have some salt, yes. I will do the steps. Sorry, I am not very fast today. I am in the kitchen, my grandmother's recipe cards are spread all over the counter, I am trying to not drop them while I hold the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize, take your time. Is there anything else I can note for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only that the end of the street, where the turn is, the snow is deeper? Maybe they can see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:43:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that, the turnaround at the end is the worst of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you. I hope they come today. I really do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do what I can on my end. Stay warm, Mr. Tran, and you have a good rest of your Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:43:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
